    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there isn't a \"something new.\" the well is dry. when you've reached the summit, the only direction left is down. i don't want to spend the next twenty years watching my hands shake and my mind dim, struggling to hold onto a ghost of what i was. there's a certain dignity in leaving while the melody is still perfect, don't you think? before the decay sets in and ruins the memory of the masterpiece.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
